{"time": "20261117T171938Z", "think": "Starting out; answering the milestone from the journal.", "command": "answer 1. I work for the Toh-Reel-Ka under Never-Writes-Twice, collecting Seal-Stones of the Kings. I hold Blackrose and Gemin; the third is in the vault in Vorannuhl deep halls. All three go into the gate at the drowned Teku-Sul Spire off Lilmoth. 2. Get the Bronze Key from Hesh-Var, a Sarpa raider in the outer yard of Vorannuhl, then open the vault door. 3. Pickpocket the key unseen, or kill Hesh-Var and take it. As a force-favouring character I lean toward fighting. 4. I do not understand why the Unbound seal trees, what moans in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar, or how Nesh-Deeka knows of the Unbound. I could find out by exploring and asking people.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.", "summary": {"stage": 10, "at": "velothi-ruin-23-m73", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-heem-scar", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "top